## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design cross-account data flows with privacy and governance, real-time ML inference, and cost controls in an enterprise multi-tenant environment.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven architecture: S3 Events → Lambda → SageMaker → DynamoDB
- Data privacy: PII masking via pattern matching, KMS encryption at rest/transit
- Data governance: Glue Data Catalog for lineage and schema registry
- Cross-account access: RAM shared resources with service control policies
- Operational excellence: Idempotent writes (deduplication via record keys), DLQ for failures, exponential backoff

## Code Example
